            { "kind": "champion", "key": "Gangplank", "start": 29, "end": 38 },
            { "kind": "keyword", "key": "slowed", "start": 104, "end": 108 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.38
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Kled:Gangplank:1",
          "text": "Dash in with Jousting only when Gangplank has few kegs ready; then use Violent Tendencies to finish the fight fast.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Kled-E", "start": 13, "end": 21 },
            { "kind": "champion", "key": "Gangplank", "start": 32, "end": 41 },
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Kled-W", "start": 71, "end": 89 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.17
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Kled:Gangplank:2",
          "text": "Stay out of keg blast zones; their explosion slows you and hits hard. Gangplank has to hit the keg himself, so make that costly.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "keyword", "key": "slowed", "start": 45, "end": 50 },
            { "kind": "champion", "key": "Gangplank", "start": 70, "end": 79 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.68
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Kled:Gangplank:3",
          "text": "Hold your trap until Remove Scurvy is used, since it cleanses the pull; then trade freely.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Gangplank-W", "start": 21, "end": 34 }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.93,
          "hidden": true
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Kled:Gangplank:4",
          "text": "Watch your steed's health against Parrrley and Trial by Fire; when you dismount, fight to refill courage and remount.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Gangplank-Q", "start": 34, "end": 42 },
            {
              "kind": "ability",
              "key": "Gangplank-passive",
              "start": 47,
              "end": 60
            }
          ],
          "pWrong": 0.1
        },
        {
          "id": "top:Kled:Gangplank:5",
          "text": "Watch for level 6; Cannon Barrage can hit you from anywhere, so don't stay low and alone.",
          "refs": [
            { "kind": "ability", "key": "Gangplank-R", "start": 19, "end": 33 },
            { "kind": "keyword", "key": "isolated", "start": 83, "end": 88 }
